// =====================================================================
//  BOSS: the Rave Goblin (the first boss). The bard's old bandmate, gone rave, with a tambourine.
//  Phase 1: three number one fans (Raphael's, boss.js) shield him while his tambourine calls in sword goblins,
//           three at a time: out of the tambourine and from behind you.
