//           you to your other side, then a combo on the next bar (a slam, then a swipe). A hit breaks your Shroom Rush.
//  Phase 3: psyched up. Bigger, throbbing, wide pupil. He stops attacking and just dances, a see-through grey ghost you can't
//           hit, while hallucinations of himself come at you from both sides (half size, half damage, one rainbow colour each,
